Description: A research project and R package evaluating the relationship 
    between the MA4 R-index (analytic stability) and the 
    Hartung-Knapp-Sidik-Jonkman (HKSJ) adjustment in meta-analysis.
    The study utilizes 77 standardized datasets from multiple R packages 
    to validate the findings.
